Zero-edge control (same daily P&L, mean removed) on MyFundedFutures Core $50K: P(pass) = 23.9% — anything close to this number is luck, not edge.

## Falsification gates (from the research brief)

- days with intraday low <= -$700: **0** of 2681
- days with intraday low <= -$1,000: **0**
- daily t-stat: **-0.74** (want > 2 on the holdout, not just in-sample)
- costs as share of gross: **77%**


